#. ねぇ、苗木…
#. ちょっといいかな…？
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hey, Makoto? Can I talk to you for a sec?"
msgstr ""

#. …どうしたの？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr ""

#. あのね…苗木に聞きたい事があるんだよね…
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I wanted to ask you something..."
msgstr ""

#. …え、何？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sure, what is it?"
msgstr ""

#. えーっとね…
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh, um..."
msgstr ""

#. そのぉ…
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I mean..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あ、あのさ！
#. ここじゃなんだから後で私の部屋に来てくれる！
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"C-Can you just come to my room when you get a chance!?\n"
"Right here is like...!"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...huh?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、後でね！
#. 絶対に来てよー！！
msgctxt "0010 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Okay, see ya later! Better not stand me up!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの返答も待たずに、
#. 朝日奈さんは走り去ってしまった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Without bothering to wait for a response, Hina ran\n"
"off...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さん、どうしたんだ…？
#. 急に部屋に呼び出すなんて…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"What's going on with her, inviting me to her room like\n"
"this...?"
msgstr ""

#. それに…様子も変だったけど…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "She's acting really strange..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>…とりあえず、行ってみるしかないか。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, I don't have much choice, do I?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんに言われたように、
#. ボクは彼女の部屋へと向かった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I headed to Hina's room like she asked...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えーっと…
msgctxt "0017 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Umm..."
msgstr ""

#. ごめんね…
#. わざわざ部屋まで来てもらっちゃって…
msgctxt "0018 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Sorry for making you have to come here..."
msgstr ""

#. いいけど…どうしたの？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, I don't mind. But what's going on?"
msgstr ""

#. あのね、苗木に聞きたい事があるんだ。
msgctxt "0020 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I just...wanted to ask you something."
msgstr ""

#. 真剣に…答えてくれる…？
msgctxt "0021 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Will you promise to give me a real answer?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Sure..."
msgstr ""

#. 私って…どうかな？
msgctxt "0023 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What do you...think about me?"
msgstr ""

#. え？
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. …女として、どうかな？
msgctxt "0025 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I mean me...as a woman."
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうって…？
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What do I think...?"
msgstr ""

#. だ、だからさぁ！
msgctxt "0027 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wh-What I'm trying to say is...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>女として魅力あるか<CLT>って…聞いてるんだよ…
msgctxt "0028 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Do I have, you know...<CLT 3>womanly charms<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それは…その…
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "W-Well, I mean..."
msgstr ""

#. …って言うか、どうして急に！？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wait, where's all this coming from!?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0031 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 昔からよく言われるんだよね。
#. <CLT 3>女らしくない<CLT>って…
msgctxt "0032 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "People have always told me how <CLT 3>I'm not ladylike<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、自分でもそう思う…
#. 私って運動以外はからっきしだし…
msgctxt "0033 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"And I mean, I can't really disagree. All I'm good at\n"
"is sports, exercise, physical stuff..."
msgstr ""

#. でもね、それって、
#. まともに恋した事がないせいだと思うんだ…
msgctxt "0034 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But I think maybe that's just because I've never\n"
"actually been in love...!"
msgstr ""

#. 恋した事がないから女らしくない…
msgctxt "0035 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Since I've never fallen in love, how can I say I'm a\n"
"woman?"
msgstr ""

#. だからさ、その…
msgctxt "0036 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So that's why... Um..."
msgstr ""

#. …<CLT 3>恋人<CLT>になって欲しいんだよね。
msgctxt "0037 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I want you to be my <CLT 3>boyfriend<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …は？
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

#. あ、違うよ！　ホントの恋人じゃないよ！
#. <CLT 3>シミュレーション<CLT>の話だって！
msgctxt "0039 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"N-No, I mean—! Not like my REAL boyfriend! Just, like,\n"
"a <CLT 3>practice run<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. …シミュレーション？
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Practice run...?"
msgstr ""

#. 恋した事ないから女らしくなれないし、
#. 女らしくないから恋も出来ない…
msgctxt "0041 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I'm not a woman because I've never been in love, and I\n"
"can't fall in love cuz I'm not a woman..."
msgstr ""

#. これって、悪循環だと思うんだよね…
msgctxt "0042 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It's like, a vicious cycle, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#. だからさ、シミュレーションをして、
#. 私の中に眠る女らしさを呼び起こそうって作戦なの！
msgctxt "0043 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So my strategy is, I'll do a practice run to draw out\n"
"my feminine side!"
msgstr ""

#. そんで、恋が出来る体質になろうって作戦なの！
msgctxt "0044 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That way I'll be in the perfect position to fall in\n"
"love!"
msgstr ""

#. だからお願い！
#. シミュレーションで私の<CLT 3>恋人役<CLT>になって！
msgctxt "0045 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So I'm asking you—begging you to help me practice and\n"
"pretend to be <CLT 3>my boyfriend<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. で、でも、そんな…
#. シミュレーションって言われても…
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But I mean...seriously?"
msgstr ""

#. こんな事を頼めるのって、
#. 苗木くらいしかいないんだよ。
msgctxt "0047 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You're the only one I can ask, Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. 私には…他に仲のいい男友達もいないしさ…
msgctxt "0048 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I mean...how many other guy friends do I have?"
msgstr ""

#. だからお願い！　切実にお願い！
#. ちょっとでいいからさ！！
msgctxt "0049 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Please! I'm on hands and knees here! It won't even\n"
"take that long!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さん…本気みたいだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina seems really serious about this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. わ、わかったよ…
#. 少しだけなら協力するよ…
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Fine... I guess I can help, for a little while."
msgstr ""

#. やった！　ホントにッ！？
msgctxt "0053 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You mean it!? Alright!"
msgstr ""

#. …それで、どうしたらいいの？
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So...what am I supposed to do?"
msgstr ""

#. えーっと…そうだなぁ…
msgctxt "0055 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh, uh...good question."
msgstr ""

#. うーんと……
msgctxt "0056 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Ummm..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0057 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ま、いっか！
#. とりあえず始めてみよう！
msgctxt "0058 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Well, whatever! Let's just get started!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とりあえず…って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Whatever...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、始めるよっ！！
msgctxt "0060 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Okay, here we go!"
msgstr ""

#. …あなた、お帰りなさい。
#. ご飯にします？　お風呂にします？
msgctxt "0061 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Oh, darling! You're home! Are you ready for dinner? Or\n"
"should I get a bath going?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、朝日奈さん…
#. それは恋人っていうより夫婦じゃ…
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Wait, Hina... That's more like a stereotypical 1950s\n"
"married couple than anything..."
msgstr ""

#. …え、違った？
msgctxt "0063 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh... Different approach, then?"
msgstr ""

#. えーっと…じゃあ…
msgctxt "0064 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "W-Well..."
msgstr ""

#. 私の事、騙したのねっ！？
#. 奥さんとは別れたって言ったじゃないっ！！
msgctxt "0065 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You lied to me! You said you left your wife!"
msgstr ""

#. それは…もっと違うよ…
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's even worse..."
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？
msgctxt "0067 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Really...?"
msgstr ""

#. ていうか、私ってシミュレーションすら出来ない！？
msgctxt "0068 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You mean I can't even get a practice run right!?"
msgstr ""

#. えっ！？　そこまで致命的だったの！？
msgctxt "0069 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Was that the fatal blow...!?"
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうしよう…本当にどうしよう…！
#. このまま…干物女として渇いてくしかないって事…？
msgctxt "0070 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Seriously, what am I supposed to do!? Just become that\n"
"one crazy lady who gives up on love!?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、そもそもさ…
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hold on, let's dial it back..."
msgstr ""

#. 無理してシミュレーションする必要なんて、
#. 本当にあるの？
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"First of all, do you really need to go through all\n"
"this practice stuff?"
msgstr ""

#. だ、だって…女らしくないって…
msgctxt "0073 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I told you...I'm not \"ladylike\"..."
msgstr ""

#. …だとしても、それも<CLT 3>朝日奈さんの魅力<CLT>じゃないかな？
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Even if that's true, I'd say that's just <CLT 3>part of your\n"
"charm<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0075 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. 無理して変わっても、
#. それは朝日奈さんじゃなくなっちゃうよ。
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If you push it and get all nervous, that's totally not\n"
"you, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さんは、朝日奈さんのままでいいと思うよ。
#. だって、それが朝日奈さんなんだもん。
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Personally, I think you're fine just the way you are.\n"
"Because, I mean, that's who you *are*."
msgstr ""

#. な、苗木…
msgctxt "0078 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Makoto..."
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、恋愛って楽しいモンでしょ？
#. 無理しても楽しくなんかないじゃん。
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And falling in love is supposed to be fun, right? If\n"
"you stress out about it, where's the fun in that?"
msgstr ""

#. …って、恋愛とかに詳しい訳じゃないボクが言っても
#. 説得力ないかもしれないけどさ…
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I mean, not that I know anything about love, either.\n"
"So maybe that doesn't mean anything..."
msgstr ""

#. ううん、そんな事ないよ…
msgctxt "0081 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "No, it does..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木が言うなら…私は信じられるよ…
msgctxt "0082 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "If it's you saying it, it *does* mean something..."
msgstr ""

#. そっか…無理しなくていいんだね…
#. 私は私のまま…
msgctxt "0083 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Maybe you're right. I shouldn't push it. I should just\n"
"be me."
msgstr ""

#. ジェイソン・ステイサムみたいな
#. 素敵な男性と巡り合えるのを待ってればいいんだね！
msgctxt "0084 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I just have to wait until I meet the right person.\n"
"Like Jason Statham."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>渋い好みだな…
#. 当分、巡り合えないかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You have very...specific taste. I think you'll be\n"
"waiting a while on that one...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ありがと、苗木！
#. なんだか、胸のつかえが取れたよ！
msgctxt "0086 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Anyway, thanks Makoto! You've definitely helped lift\n"
"that weight off my chest!"
msgstr ""

#. それにさ、ちょっと楽しかったし…
#. 苗木とのシミュレーション…
msgctxt "0087 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"And on top of that...I kinda had fun practicing with\n"
"you."
msgstr ""

#. いつか、また手伝ってもらおーっと！
msgctxt "0088 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I might ask you to help me again someday!"
msgstr ""

#. い、いや…ボクはもういいって…
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "N-No, I think that's enough practice for me..."
msgstr ""

#. あっ、そう？
msgctxt "0090 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh, really?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…シミュレーションじゃなかったりして…
msgctxt "0091 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Then...if it wasn't practice...?"
msgstr ""

#. えっ？
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. …なーんてね！　冗談だよ！
msgctxt "0093 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Kidding! I'm just jerkin' ya around!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだ…冗談か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A joke, huh?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、冗談でもなんでも、
#. 朝日奈さんと仲良くなれたのは確かだよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0095 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, joke or not...I definitely feel like I've gotten\n"
"a lot closer to Hina.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>色々話せたお陰で、
#. 彼女の事もよくわかったし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0096 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After going through all this with her, I think I\n"
"understand her a lot better.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当の意味で、彼女と<CLT><CLT 3>“仲間”<CLT><CLT 4>になれた。
#. なんだか、そんな気がする。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think we've finally become <CLT><CLT 3>friends<CLT><CLT 4> in the truest\n"
"sense of the word.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …それで、苗木の好みのタイプは？
#. どんな女の子が好きなの？
msgctxt "0098 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So? What's your type, huh? What kinda girls are you\n"
"into!?"
msgstr ""

#. …えっ？
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. い、いや、ボクはいいって！
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "D-Don't worry about it!"
msgstr ""

#. まぁまぁ！　照れなさんなって！！
msgctxt "0101 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Awww, come on! Don't get embarrassed!"
msgstr ""

#. アハハハハ！
msgctxt "0102 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>朝日奈葵の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0103 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Hina's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. スキル<CLT><CLT 3>“両手利き”<CLT><CLT 23>を獲得致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0104 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You just unlocked the skill <CLT><CLT 3>Ambidextrousness<CLT><CLT 23>!\n"
"Give yourself a pat on the back. You've earned it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんと慣れない恋愛話で盛り上がった後、
#. ボクは自分の部屋へと戻っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina and I got more fired up about love than I\n"
"expected, and then I went back to my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
